{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SytAdjacentSwap","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SytAdjacentSwap","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.StandardYoungTableau"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_other","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_other","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L131-L142","doc":"Away from `p` and `q`, the swapped tableau agrees with the original. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_at_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_at_q","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L126-L129","doc":"The swapped tableau carries `p`'s label at cell `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_at_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_at_p","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L120-L124","doc":"The swapped tableau carries `q`'s label at cell `p`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT_entry_mem","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L114-L118","doc":"On a cell, the swapped tableau applies `swapSucc` to the original entry. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_succ","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L106-L107","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_self","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L104-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapCellsSYT","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L58-L102","doc":"**The consecutive-label cell-swap standard tableau.**  Exchange the entries of\nthe cells `p` and `q` (holding labels `a` and `a+1`) that lie in different rows\nand different columns; the result is again a `StandardYoungTableau μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_lt_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_lt_card","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L51-L56","doc":"`swapSucc a` keeps values below a common bound `c`, provided `a` and `a+1` are\nbelow `c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_lt","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L45-L49","doc":"`swapSucc a` preserves `<` **except** on the single pair `(a, a+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc_injective","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L39-L43","doc":"`swapSucc a` is an involution, hence injective. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.swapSucc","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SytAdjacentSwap.lean#L35-L37","doc":"**The successor-swap involution on `ℕ`**: exchange `a` and `a+1`, fix all else.\nThis is the value-level shadow of exchanging the two consecutive labels. ","signatureChunk":0}]}